# Route: guide 50 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to 60, 19
# quests, 7.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades, Burning Steppes, Redridge Mountains, Stranglethorn
# Vale, Swamp of Sorrows, The Barrens, Azshara): The Bulwark -> Ruins of
# Thaurissan -> Lakeshire -> Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore ->
# Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Zuuldaia Ruins -> Splinterspear Junction ->
# Ratchet -> Ravencrest Monument.
#
# Left out: Uniting the Shattered Amulet (3627): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Remember That I Love You (92415), Crest of Lordaeron
# (95189), Bloodied Insignia (95195), Abominable Creatures (95250), Dark Iron
# Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The Heart of the Mountain (4123),
# Marshal Windsor (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put Her Down (4701), Egg Freezing
# (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Doomrigger's Clasp (4764), Maxwell's Mission
# (5081), General Drakkisath's Demise (5102), What Comes Around... (386), What
# Comes Around... (386), Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772),
# Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

